 276: ### Handed on: where the threads end
 277: 
 278: Media Arts, grades 9 to 12 is the last media arts course; its threads end here. Level 3 hands every thread to Level 4
 279: (ma-g11-ideas, ma-g11-make and ma-g11-craft to ma-g12-studio; ma-g11-present to ma-g12-exhibit; ma-g11-read and
