 341: ## Cross-subject
 342: 
 343: No media arts row of Levels 1 to 4 carries a cross_subject lean (data/progressions/arts.csv), so this course waits on
 344: no other course and no other course waits on it. STANDARD.md 6's media arts and computer science line holds: each
 345: unit teaches the one idea of privacy, consent or copyright it needs in a short step (units 1, 2, 7, 12 and 18), and
 346: leans on no computer science course (computer science is not core, lesson 32). Because a level is open to students in
 347: any grade, no contact below assumes a grade's course was taken; each is practiced, not owned, with its "if later"
 348: line. All are core courses.
